content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import additional tasks\n  import_tasks: assert.yml\n\n- name: Install DNS packages\n  package:\n    name: "{{ dns_packages }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create directories for DNS data and configuration\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item.path }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: "{{ item.mode }}"\n    owner: "{{ item.owner }}"\n    group: "{{ item.group }}"\n  loop:\n    - { path: "{{ dns_data_dir }}", mode: "{{ dns_data_dir_mode }}", owner: "{{ dns_owner }}", group: "{{ dns_group }}" }\n    - { path: "{{ dns_config_dir }}", mode: "{{ dns_config_dir_mode }}", owner: "{{ dns_owner }}", group: "{{ dns_group }}" }\n\n- name: Create DNS group\n  group:\n    name: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create DNS user\n  user:\n    name: "{{ dns_owner }}"\n    system: true\n    state: present\n\n- name: Generate rndc key file\n  shell: rndc-confgen -a -c "{{ dns_config_dir }}/rndc.key" -r /dev/urandom\n  args:\n    creates: "{{ dns_config_dir }}/rndc.key"\n\n- name: Set permissions on rndc key file\n  file:\n    path: "{{ dns_config_dir }}/rndc.key"\n    owner: "{{ dns_owner }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0400\'\n\n- name: Get the hints/root file\n  get_url:\n    url: "https://www.internic.net/domain/named.root"\n    dest: "{{ dns_data_dir }}/root.hints"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  when: dns_caching_dns | bool\n\n- name: Create zone files from templates\n  template:\n    src: "{{ item.template }}"\n    dest: "{{ dns_data_dir }}/{{ item.zone_file }}"\n  loop: "{{ dns_zones }}"\n  notify: reload rndc\n\n- name: Generate main DNS configuration file\n  template:\n    src: named.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ dns_config_dir }}/named.conf"\n  notify: restart dns\n\n- name: Create systemd override configuration files\n  template:\n    src: systemd-overrides.j2\n    dest: "/etc/systemd/system/dns.service.d/override.conf"\n  notify: reload systemd\n  when: use_systemd | bool\n\n- name: Start and enable DNS service\n  service:\n    name: dns\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n```\n\nThis playbook adheres to the specified tasks and conditions, ensuring that it can be integrated directly into an Ansible Role under the `tasks/` directory. Each task is structured to follow Ansible best practices, with appropriate use of variables, conditions, and notifications.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-05T11:26:59.38383189Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 11884952072, 'load_duration': 47134906, 'prompt_eval_count': 580, 'prompt_eval_duration': 334269336, 'eval_count': 582, 'eval_duration': 11502812484, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--bf0b7f00-f9e5-46a1-8715-5ae1647306bf-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 580, 'output_tokens': 582, 'total_tokens': 1162}
