 dns\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n```\n\nThis corrected playbook addresses the issues identified by yamllint, specifically by removing extra spaces inside braces and ensuring lines do not exceed 80 characters. The functional intent and task order remain unchanged.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-05T11:28:03.160604525Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 13285364681, 'load_duration': 56007633, 'prompt_eval_count': 1217, 'prompt_eval_duration': 428273499, 'eval_count': 568, 'eval_duration': 12800211705, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--f8b68b50-097b-4362-8546-0b7933e85a3c-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1217, 'output_tokens': 568, 'total_tokens': 1785}  9%|▉         | 9/100 [07:23<1:20:57, 53.38s/it]
