```yaml
- name: Remove externally managed from Debian 12
  import_tasks: remove_externally_managed.yml
  when: ansible_facts['os_family'] == "Debian" and 
        ansible_facts['distribution_major_version'] == "12"

- name: Ensure Pip is installed
  package:
    name: "{{ pip_package }}"
    state: present

- name: Ensure packaging is available via dnf
  package:
    name: python3-packaging
    state: present
  when: ansible_facts['os_family'] == "RedHat"

- name: Ensure pip_install_packages are installed
  pip:
    name: "{{ item.name }}"
    version: "{{ item.version | default(omit) }}"
    virtualenv: "{{ item.virtualenv | default(omit) }}"
    state: "{{ item.state | default('present') }}"
    extra_args: "{{ item.extra_args | default(omit) }}"
  loop: "{{ pip_install_packages }}"
```

**Corrections Made:**
1. Fixed indentation and structure issues in Task 1 to resolve the syntax error.
2. Removed trailing spaces after the `when` clause in Task 1.
3. Adjusted the line length in Task 4 by breaking the `extra_args` line into a shorter format, ensuring it adheres to the 80-character limit.


