ms: "{{ unauthorized_keys }}"\n\n- name: Copy generated private SSH key for user\n  ansible.builtin.copy:\n    src: "/home/{{ user_name }}/.ssh/id_rsa"\n    dest: "{{ user_home }}/.ssh/id_rsa"\n    owner: "{{ user_name }}"\n    mode: \'0600\'\n\n- name: Check users password valid time for user\n  ansible.builtin.command:\n    cmd: "chage -l {{ user_name }}"\n    register: chage_output\n\n- name: Set users password valid time for user\n  ansible.builtin.command:\n    cmd: "chage -E {{ expiry_date }} {{ user_name }}"\n```\n\nThis YAML playbook adheres to the specified tasks and uses Ansible modules to accomplish each task. Note that you may need to customize variables like `user_name`, `user_comment`, `user_home`, `user_shell`, `user_state`, `user_sudo_access`, `authorized_keys_path`, `unauthorized_keys`, and `expiry_date` according to your environment and requirements.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-05T12:03:58.538302388Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 15321076975, 'load_duration': 50504368, 'prompt_eval_count': 722, 'prompt_eval_duration': 357682905, 'eval_count': 740, 'eval_duration': 14912327439, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--7beef69d-f600-4905-8775-10cc54b350f8-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 722, 'output_tokens': 740, 'total_tokens': 1462}
