Task 3: Set agent taints
Description Task 3: Configure agent node taints when the node type is set to 'agent'.

Task 4: Copy RKE2 configuration file
Description Task 4: Copy the RKE2 configuration file from a template to the appropriate location with specific permissions and notify a handler.

Task 5: Copy Kubelet configuration file
Description Task 5: Copy the Kubelet configuration file from a template when the Kubelet configuration is provided, with specific permissions and notify a handler.

Task 6: Copy Containerd Registry Configuration file
Description Task 6: Copy the Containerd Registry Configuration file from a specified path when custom registry settings are provided, with specific permissions and notify a handler.

Task 7: Start RKE2 service on other nodes
Description Task 7: Start the RKE2 service on all nodes except the current one, ensuring it is enabled and notify a handler upon changes.

Task 8: Mask other RKE2 services on nodes
Description Task 8: Mask other RKE2 services (agent or server) on nodes based on the current node type.

Task 9: Wait for remaining nodes to be ready - no CNI
Description Task 9: Poll each node to check if it is ready when CNI is not configured, until all nodes report as ready.

